WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
The promise. The public site leads with a concrete content-kit outcome rather than an open-ended AI prompt.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Three steps. A short, three-step explanation sets expectations about the effort and the result before sign-up.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Dashboard. The signed-in overview brings the Start Interview action and the available content formats together.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Interview focus. Goal-aware choices turn a broad ambition into an interview direction without asking users to write a brief.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Voice. Plain-language voice options help users shape the content while keeping the setup focused.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Recording setup. The camera frame, clip-safe guide, and microphone feedback explain how to prepare for usable recordings.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Content-kit demo. The public demo pairs an interview clip with its narrative to make the source-to-output relationship visible.
